flowchart LR
  A[BuildManifest and updater metadata] --> B[FirmwareUpdateLauncher]
  B --> C[Compiled helper basename selection]
  C -->|selected -p and -s invocation| D[Helper result plist]
  D --> E[BlessData]
  E --> F[bless staging]
  F --> G[Indexed EFI payload path and NVRAM request]
  G --> H[MultiUpdater child lookup]
  H --> I[Optional IMG4 verification request]
  I -. device policy unobserved .-> J[Flasher and controller firmware]
